122
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:24,380
Talk about a loser!

123
00:06:26,840 --> 00:06:28,240
Why are you laughing?

124
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:31,577
You should have stood up to him, Shanks!

125
00:06:31,660 --> 00:06:33,260
That wasn't cool at all!

126
00:06:33,520 --> 00:06:36,917
If you can laugh over something
like that, then you're not a man!

127
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,340
Or a real pirate!

128
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,715
Look, Luffy, I know how you feel, kid.

129
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,617
But all the guy did was
spill a little booze on me.

130
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:46,935
It's not worth getting so upset about.

131
00:06:49,340 --> 00:06:50,760
Hey, wait a second.

132
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:52,000
Leave me alone!

133
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:53,455
