138
00:07:06,660 --> 00:07:08,680
Yeah, the Gum-Gum fruit we looted!

139
00:07:08,840 --> 00:07:10,057
It was right in here!

140
00:07:10,140 --> 00:07:11,434
Luffy, tell the truth!

141
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,517
Did you just eat something like this?

142
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:14,620
Uh, yeah.

143
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:16,392
It tasted gross, though.

144
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,720
What have you done?

145
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:20,717
The Gum-Gum fruit is one of
the legendary devil fruits.

146
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,697
It makes your body turn into rubber.

147
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:26,597
That means you've lost the ability
to swim for the rest of your life!

148
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,780
That can't be!

149
00:07:28,340 --> 00:07:29,260
You idiot!

150
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:36,560
Hey, Fish Guy, can I have a fishy?

151
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,080
Luffy, it's you!

152
00:07:38,360 --> 00:07:41,477
I heard you missed out on another
big adventure with the pirates.

153
00:07:41,560 --> 00:07:42,390
That's okay.

154
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,480
My body's laid out a rubber now.

155
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:47,679
This is more fun than going
on a voyage anyway, see?

156
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:53,269
The crew's been out at
sea for a long time.

157
00:07:53,380 --> 00:07:54,477
Isn't that right, Luffy?

158
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,900
I bet you missed them. No way.

159
00:07:57,200 --> 00:07:59,082
I'm still upset with those guys.

160
00:07:59,260 --> 00:08:01,497
I thought Shanks and his
crew were cool pirates,

161
00:08:01,580 --> 00:08:03,397
but it turns out they're
all totally wimpy.

162
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:04,310
I don't know.

163
00:08:04,393 --> 00:08:06,277
I think being able to laugh after somebody

164
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,617
humiliates you like those
bandits did is cool,

165
00:08:08,700 --> 00:08:09,530
too.

166
00:08:09,613 --> 00:08:11,137
You don't understand, Monk, you know.

167
00:08:11,220 --> 00:08:13,617
Sometimes a man's gotta
stand up and fight.

168
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:14,530
You're right.

169
00:08:14,613 --> 00:08:15,877
Maybe I don't get it, huh?

170
00:08:15,960 --> 00:08:17,360
We're back for more.

171
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:21,397
Looks like those damn
pirates aren't here today.

172
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:25,480
We were in the neighborhood, so we
thought we'd stop in for a drink.

173
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:31,989
What's the hold of, honey?

174
00:08:32,100 --> 00:08:33,520
Bring the booze!

175
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,540
Neo, please help!

176
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:41,400
What's the matter, Machido? It's Luffy!

177
00:08:41,660 --> 00:08:42,880
He's in big trouble!

178
00:08:44,060 --> 00:08:45,240
Let go of him!

179
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,049
Well, this is interesting.

180
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:50,157
You're gonna pay for that!

181
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:52,005
This kid is a freak of nature.

182
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:58,697
See your side for last time, right now!

183
00:08:58,780 --> 00:09:01,545
How much money we could
get if we sold him off?

184
00:09:07,460 --> 00:09:10,989
Fine I don't think I said
anything to offend you personally.

185
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:22,157
He's a child I don't
intend to fight you and

186
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:25,217
I'll even pay you to stop
this just let him live.

187
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:26,897
That's all I ask?

188
00:09:26,980 --> 00:09:28,960
Ah, senior citizen.

189
00:09:29,280 --> 00:09:31,221
Leave it to you to be reasonable.

190
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,033
But you're out of luck.

191
00:09:34,660 --> 00:09:39,542
The rat's already made me angry, so not
even your pitiful prayers can save him now.

192
00:09:39,680 --> 00:09:40,510
Please, no!

193
00:09:40,780 --> 00:09:43,457
That rubber face of yours was
real entertaining for a sec,

194
00:09:43,540 --> 00:09:45,617
but now all I want to do is bash it in.

195
00:09:45,700 --> 00:09:47,077
You guys don't fight fair!

196
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,740
You're scum! Let me go!

197
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,617
Forget selling him.

198
00:09:52,700 --> 00:09:53,880
Let's just kill him.

199
00:09:55,380 --> 00:09:56,210
Luffy!

200
00:09:56,293 --> 00:09:57,480
Have mercy on him, sir!

201
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,240
Nobody was at the port to greet us.

202
00:10:05,460 --> 00:10:07,540
I figured something must be wrong.

203
00:10:08,540 --> 00:10:10,280
The mountain bandits again?

204
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:12,700
Captain, you're here! Hey, Luffy,

205
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:14,617
didn't you say before that your punches

206
00:10:14,700 --> 00:10:17,347
were as deadly as getting
shot with a pistol?

207
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,680
Shut up, okay?

208
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:20,175
You're still in town?

209
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:21,400
Shove off already.

210
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:27,217
You'd best leave before
you get hurt take one step

211
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:30,712
closer and my friend here's
gonna blow your head clean off

212
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:36,018
Didn't you hear what the man said
do you feel like dying today, buddy?

213
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:42,297
Well now that you've drawn your pistol
do you plan to actually use it boy?

214
00:10:42,380 --> 00:10:44,357
I'm holding it ain't I what I'm trying to

215
