239
00:12:12,740 --> 00:12:13,570
Amazing.

240
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:14,880
No, hold on.

241
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:17,317
The kid was the one who
attacked us first, all right?

242
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,341
Either way, you're still
a wanted man, aren't you?

243
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:23,240
