244
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:24,720
Come with me!

245
00:12:28,440 --> 00:12:29,270
Luffy!

246
00:12:29,353 --> 00:12:31,197
Aw, crap, I let the bandit take him.

247
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,237
What are we gonna do?

248
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,150
Calm down, boss.

249
00:12:33,233 --> 00:12:34,517
There's no use freaking out over it.

250
00:12:34,600 --> 00:12:37,280
We'll find him in no
time, I swear. Oh, boy.

251
00:12:37,620 --> 00:12:38,973
Can't believe this guy.

252
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,180
Guess I made a clean getaway.

253
00:12:43,740 --> 00:12:44,570
Sorry.

254
00:12:44,653 --> 00:12:46,107
Got no need for you anymore.

255
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:52,437
See you, Root. Damn it! I suck!

256
00:12:52,520 --> 00:12:56,557
These guys are worthless bandits,
but I still couldn't get one hit in!

257
00:12:56,640 --> 00:12:57,560
I hate this!

258
00:12:57,700 --> 00:12:58,620
It's not fair!

259
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,797
Guys, did you see the
looks on their faces?

260
00:13:03,880 --> 00:13:08,040
All pirates are nothing but
cowards and weaklings. Shut up!

261
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:10,017
Don't make fun of them like that!

262
00:13:10,100 --> 00:13:10,940
Muffy, no!

263
00:13:12,340 --> 00:13:15,320
Take back what you said
about Shakes and his crew!

264
00:13:22,620 --> 00:13:24,240
Stupid brat.

265
00:13:30,520 --> 00:13:31,580
What the hell?

266
00:13:34,300 --> 00:13:36,040
Help me!

267
00:13:56,500 --> 00:13:58,920
Oh, Jake, you found me!

268
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,500
Get lost!

269
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:32,100
I'm in your debt, Luffy.

270
00:14:32,660 --> 00:14:35,097
Machine told me about
how you stood up for us,

271
00:14:35,180 --> 00:14:38,651
how you were willing to fight
and put yourself on the line.

272
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,500
Hold on, you can't cry.

273
00:14:41,900 --> 00:14:43,260
You're a man now.

274
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:46,660
I know, but this is bad.

275
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:49,700
You lost your arm!

276
00:14:52,960 --> 00:14:54,980
Oh, no need to worry about that.

277
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:56,415
I've got another one.

278
00:14:56,900 --> 00:14:58,580
I'm just glad you're safe.

279
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:11,300
Luffy learned many
important things that day.

280
00:15:11,560 --> 00:15:14,640
The harshness of the sea,
his own powerlessness,

281
00:15:15,020 --> 00:15:19,320
and most importantly, the
greatness of a man called Shanks.

282
00:15:20,200 --> 00:15:23,257
That's when young Luffy
resolved with all his heart.

283
00:15:23,340 --> 00:15:25,380
He would become like him.

284
00:15:27,940 --> 00:15:28,770
Jinx!

285
00:15:28,853 --> 00:15:30,997
Are you really about to
leave the village for good?

286
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:31,910
Uh-huh.

287
00:15:31,993 --> 00:15:33,557
Yep, it's time for us to part ways.

288
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:35,522
I bet you'll miss me, won't you?

289
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:38,677
Yeah, but I'm not gonna
beg to come with you,

290
00:15:38,760 --> 00:15:42,100
because I'm gonna become
a pirate all on my own!

291
00:15:42,940 --> 00:15:45,137
That's good, because I wouldn't
bring you with me anyways.

292
00:15:45,220 --> 00:15:47,517
I mean, you'll never make
it as a pirate, kiddo.

293
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,560
We'll too!

294
00:15:48,900 --> 00:15:49,960
Just wait and see!

295
00:15:50,260 --> 00:15:52,877
I'll round up a crew that's
every bit as good as yours!

296
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:55,437
And we'll find the
world's greatest treasure!

297
00:15:55,520 --> 00:15:57,880
And I'm gonna be king of the pirates!

298
00:16:00,120 --> 00:16:00,950
Oh?

299
00:16:01,033 --> 00:16:02,580
Planning to outdo me, are ya?

300
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:05,670
Okay.

301
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:11,880
If that's the case, I'll leave this here.

302
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,660
It means more to me than anything.

303
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:25,560
Give it back someday.

304
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:28,400
After you become a great pirate.

305
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:30,190
Okay.

306
00:16:31,100 --> 00:16:34,220
It really does have potential. I know.

307
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:37,246
He reminds me of myself
back when I was a kid.

308
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:39,600
Set sail!

309
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:47,480
One decade later, Luffy's own pirate
adventure began at the very same port.

310
00:16:52,420 --> 00:16:54,857
I can't believe Luffy's finally leaving.

311
00:16:54,940 --> 00:16:58,260
Becoming a pirate is a great
dishonor to our village!

312
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,600
Couldn't ask for a better day for this?

313
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:13,077
Hey, it's this big guy again.

314
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,677
You shouldn't have done that.

315
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:17,936
Cause I've been training a
lot over the past 10 years!

316
00:17:25,620 --> 00:17:26,450
PISTOL!

317
00:17:36,800 --> 00:17:39,000
That Outta T .J., you stupid fish!

318
00:17:45,940 --> 00:17:47,700
It's time to get going!

319
00:17:48,420 --> 00:17:53,580
I'm setting out to become
King of the Pirates! We are!

320
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,400
We are!
